  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "🌴Premier Luxury WaterColor Location-Perfect for Families🌴<br>Experience the best of WaterColor, consistently ranked as the #1 family vacation destination, from this beautifully designed coastal retreat just steps from the Dragonfly Pool and minutes from everything 30A has to offer.<br><br>Prime Location & Resort Amenities:<br>-1-minute walk to Dragonfly Pool<br>-Short golf cart ride to WaterColor Beach Club, Camp WaterColor, The Boathouse, Frog Pool, and more<br>-Up to 12 WaterColor Amenity Bands are available and costs are included in the reservation quote<br>-Access to 9 resort-style community pools, with one including a fun filled lazy river, all heated year-round along with a beach side bar & chairs/umbrellas available for rent<br>-Poolside dining, ice cream, and convenience shops throughout the community<br><br>Transportation & Outdoor Fun Included:<br>-2021 street-legal 6-seat Polaris GEM golf cart<br>-4 adult beach bikes<br>-Full set of beach gear: chairs, beach tent, coolers, puddle jumpers, tents, and toys<br><br>Family-Friendly Features:<br>-2 Pack ’n Plays, high chair, car seats, stroller & all the children's games for indoor fun<br>-High-speed Wi-Fi and Smart TVs throughout<br>-Office nook for remote work or planning your next adventure<br><br>Welcome to GrazSea – A Luxury Coastal Escape<br>Relax and recharge in this spacious 4-bedroom, 4.5-bath luxury home, thoughtfully designed to accommodate up to 12 guests in comfort and style. Newly built and tastefully decorated with a light coastal ambiance, this two-story retreat offers an open-concept layout ideal for family gatherings and entertaining.<br><br>The main living area features cozy seating, a generous dining space, and a fully equipped gourmet kitchen with stainless steel appliances, Keurig coffee maker, Ninja blender, hand mixer, and everything needed to prepare meals with ease. Step outside to two inviting porches, each featuring oversized bed swings—perfect for afternoon lounging or evening relaxation.<br><br>🛏️ Spacious & Flexible Sleeping Arrangements<br>-Two Master Suites (King Beds)<br>-One downstairs with a 50\" large screen TV and ensuite bath<br>-One upstairs with a 55\" large screen TV and access to a screened balcony with a twin bed swing<br>-Guest Bedroom with two full beds, ensuite bath, and 50\" large screen TV<br>-Custom Twin Bunk Room with built-in bunks and 32\" large screen TV<br>-Extra sleeping options at no charge:-Two twin rollaway beds with memory foam mattresses and large sectional sofa in the upstairs family room<br><br>All TVs include access to popular streaming services, and complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi is available throughout the home.<br><br>🌊 Everything You Need—And More<br>We’ve thought of every detail so you can travel light. Enjoy a full-size washer and dryer, iron, ironing board, and laundry detergent. Head to the beach fully prepared with our provided gear—or take advantage of towel service at the WaterColor Beach Club.<br><br>Whether you’re spending the day at the beach, exploring scenic 30A, or relaxing poolside, GrazSea offers the perfect blend of luxury, comfort, and carefree coastal living.<br><br><br>*We are only able to accommodate wristbands for amenity access for the amount of people on your reservation. Unfortunately, we are unable to accommodate last minute changes to the amount of wristbands. Changes must be made at least 10 days prior to arrival. Thank you for your understanding. <br>***Wristbands are required at all Watercolor amenities for guests ages 5 and older. Please note that our HOA requires a 48 hour notice to supply amenity bands for reservations. We are unable to obtain wristbands without a 48 hour notice during M-F business hours.<br><br>House Rules:<br>No Smoking, No Parties, No Pets unless prior approval up to maximum of 2 (Dogs Only)<br><br>Minimum renter age is 25.<br><br>Guest must sign Renter Agreement and Golf Cart/Bike Waivers, provide a valid & current copy of all guests' 18+ U.S. Driver's License, provide a valid & current copy of Auto Insurance for all guests 25+, and names/ages of all guests on reservation within 24 hours of booking or reservation will be cancelled. Must be U.S. Citizen to book. Signer of agreements must have a valid U.S. Driver's License and valid U.S. Auto Insurance in their name. <br><br>Quiet Time is ENFORCED 10:00 PM through 8:00 AM<br><br>Security Deposit required of $350 and up to $500. Deposit to be processed by Host on guest's credit card unless already included during booking.<br><br>Additional Pet Fee required of $375.00-$450.00 per pet. Please specify if your pet is an ESA or SD. If you bring a pet you will be required to supply current pet vaccination records.<br><br>Amount of guests on reservation will be the amount of amenity wristbands you will receive for your stay. There will be no changes to the amount of wristbands - it is based on the amount of guests on the initial reservation.<br><br>CHECK-IN: You will receive an email 72 hours before check-in with check-in instructions. Our concierge will meet you on-site for check-in to complete a walk-through, and you will be required to complete the check-in form (please note that only the person whose name is on the reservation can complete the required check-in form). Our concierge will release the door code to the home upon your arrival. We will coordinate with you on the day of check-in for arrival times.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "LUX Watercolor 4 BD, Beach Club PF, Pool Golf Cart"
        }
      ],
